
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sweet Treats Bakery</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fffaf6;
            color: #44352f;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Header and navigation */
        header {
            background-color: #713f35;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 7%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 27px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffd6a5;
        }

        /* Hero banner */
        .hero {
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    rgba(45, 20, 15, 0.55),
                    rgba(45, 20, 15, 0.55)
                ),
                url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80")
                center/cover no-repeat;

            min-height: 360px;
            padding: 90px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f4a261;
            color: #43251f;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #ffd6a5;
        }

        /* Product categories */
        .categories {
            padding: 35px 7%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .categories h2,
        .products h2,
        .offers h2,
        .about h2,
        .contact h2 {
            color: #713f35;
            font-size: 29px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .category-list {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .category {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #00000012;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Cake and bakery products */
        .products {
            padding: 40px 7%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .product-list {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .product {
            background-color: white;
            width: 250px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #00000015;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .product:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }

        .product img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 185px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .product h3 {
            color: #713f35;
            margin: 12px 8px 5px;
        }

        .product p {
            margin: 6px 10px;
        }

        .price {
            color: #287747;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .offer-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #fce4d6;
            color: #9b3d2a;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .order-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #713f35;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 9px 18px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 10px 0 18px;
        }

        .order-btn:hover {
            background-color: #9b5b4d;
        }

        /* Special offers */
        .offers {
            background-color: #f9e6dc;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .offers p {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        /* About section */
        .about {
            padding: 45px 12%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about p {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* Contact section */
        .contact {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact p {
            margin: 8px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #713f35;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        /* Responsive design */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav {
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px 7px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .categories,
            .products {
                padding: 30px 5%;
            }

            .product {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 320px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <h1>Sweet Treats Bakery</h1>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#categories">Categories</a>
            <a href="#products">Our Menu</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Main banner -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Freshly Baked with Love</h2>
        <p>Delicious cakes, pastries and cookies for every occasion.</p>
        <a href="#products" class="btn">Explore Our Menu</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Categories -->
    <section class="categories" id="categories">
        <h2>Our Categories</h2>

        <div class="category-list">
            <div class="category">🎂 Birthday Cakes</div>
            <div class="category">🧁 Cupcakes</div>
            <div class="category">🥐 Pastries</div>
            <div class="category">🍪 Cookies</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product menu -->
    <section class="products" id="products">
        <h2>Our Best Sellers</h2>

        <div class="product-list">

            <div class="product">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
                    alt="Chocolate celebration cake">

                <span class="offer-tag">Customer Favourite</span>
                <h3>Chocolate Cake</h3>
                <p>Rich, soft and delicious chocolate cake.</p>
                <p class="price">₹599</p>
                <a href="#contact" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
            </div>

            <div class="product">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486427944299-d1955d23e34d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
                    alt="Colourful cupcakes">

                <span class="offer-tag">Freshly Baked</span>
                <h3>Vanilla Cupcakes</h3>
                <p>Soft vanilla cupcakes with creamy topping.</p>
                <p class="price">₹299</p>
                <a href="#contact" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
            </div>

            <div class="product">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555507036-ab1f4038808a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
                    alt="Fresh golden pastries">

                <span class="offer-tag">Popular Choice</span>
                <h3>Fresh Pastries</h3>
                <p>Light and flaky pastries for your snack time.</p>
                <p class="price">₹199</p>
                <a href="#contact" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
            </div>

            <div class="product">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499636136210-6f4ee915583e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
                    alt="Homemade chocolate cookies">

                <span class="offer-tag">Special Treat</span>
                <h3>Chocolate Cookies</h3>
                <p>Crunchy cookies with delicious chocolate chips.</p>
                <p class="price">₹149</p>
                <a href="#contact" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Special offer -->
    <section class="offers">
        <h2>Sweet Deals for You!</h2>
        <p>Celebrate your special moments with our delicious cakes.</p>
        <p><strong>Special offer:</strong> Get 10% off on selected cakes.</p>
        <a href="#products" class="btn">View Our Menu</a>
    </section>

    <!-- About us -->
    <section class="about" id="about">
        <h2>About Our Bakery</h2>

        <p>
            Sweet Treats Bakery is a sample bakery website created to
            showcase delicious cakes, cupcakes, pastries and cookies.
            We believe every celebration becomes sweeter with a tasty
            treat. Explore our menu and discover something special
            for birthdays, parties and everyday moments.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>Email: sweettreats@example.com</p>
        <p>Phone: +91 98765 43210</p>
        <p>Location: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh</p>
        <p>Opening Hours: Monday - Saturday, 9:00 AM - 8:00 PM</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Sweet Treats Bakery. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
